# AmL Diagnostic is never a store app

AmL Diagnostic is a **local in-house** Windows tool. It will **never** ship on
AmL One, the community shelf, downloads.aml.one, or Frankfurt OTA.

```
❌ OFFICIAL_LISTINGS / catalog.ts row for Diagnostic
❌ Store icon, blurb, or app-info for Diagnostic
❌ POST /api/publish/android (or any store publish API)
❌ OTA manifests, version.json, or a downloads page
❌ Treat "publish" / "build the app" as a store or OTA release
```

`publish` / `build the app` for this repo is local build + `graphify update .`
+ GitHub only. See `publish-workflow.mdc`.
